  "notes": "Most commonly encountered in political and international contexts, especially regarding {経済|けいざい}{制裁|せいさい} (economic sanctions). Also used in organizational and social contexts for disciplinary measures.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {経済|けいざい}{制裁|せいさい} (economic sanctions)\n- {制裁|せいさい}を{科|か}す (impose sanctions)\n- {制裁|せいさい}を{加|くわ}える (inflict punishment)\n- {制裁|せいさい}{措置|そち} (punitive measures)\n- {制裁|せいさい}{決議|けつぎ} (sanctions resolution)",
